DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
13035::$$$message_0103_0000_0000$$$::"Well, I might as well since I found it."[lr]::
13036::$$$message_0103_0000_0001$$$::Stop.[lr]::
13037::$$$message_0103_0000_0002$$$::There isn't anything there. Don't do anything unnecessary. Don't look at anything unnecessary.[lr]::
13038::$$$message_0103_0000_0003$$$::No, it's close, but if I'm going to investigate, then in a slightly different place...::
13039::$$$message_0103_0001_0000$$$::"...It seems like it's a completely abandoned building. I should be able to get away with peeking inside a bit."::
13040::$$$message_0103_0002_0000$$$::I open the unlocked door.[lr]::
13041::$$$message_0103_0002_0001$$$::I walk through the hallway that hasn't been used for years.[lr]::
13042::$$$message_0103_0002_0002$$$::I go up the long, long staircase.[lr]::
13043::$$$message_0103_0002_0003$$$::I'm such an idiot. I couldn't kill my curiosity even after saying this much.[lr]::
13044::$$$message_0103_0002_0004$$$::And I'm paying for this by...::
13045::$$$message_0103_0003_0000$$$::"...Woah. It's a totally normal house."[lr]::
13046::$$$message_0103_0003_0001$$$::Coming back to me like "great pains but all in vain."::
13047::$$$message_0103_0004_0000$$$::"...It's in good condition even though it's been abandoned. I wonder if there's a manager that comes to clean sometimes."[lr]::
13048::$$$message_0103_0004_0001$$$::I investigate the dust on the floor.[lr]::
13049::$$$message_0103_0004_0002$$$::By how much it's piled up, it seems like it's been about half a year since people stopped using the building.::
13050::$$$message_0103_0005_0000$$$::"...No way. T-This place has[line len=2]"[lr]::
13051::$$$message_0103_0005_0001$$$::There's no evidence on site.[lr]::
13052::$$$message_0103_0005_0002$$$::The traces of existence[line len=2]where did they go?[line len=2]have been erased completely.[lr]::
13053::$$$message_0103_0005_0003$$$::There's not a single suspicious thing here.[lr]::
13054::$$$message_0103_0005_0004$$$::The unknown Servant and Master haven't existed from the start.[lr]::
13055::$$$message_0103_0005_0005$$$::That's why I said there's no use in investigating here.::
13056::$$$message_0103_0006_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
13057::$$$message_0103_0006_0001$$$::I feel dizzy.[lr]::
13058::$$$message_0103_0006_0002$$$::For a moment, an image that isn't mine flashes before my eyes and disperses right away.::
13059::$$$message_0103_0007_0000$$$::"...Huh? What am I thinking? It's not like I was looking for anything."[lr]::
13060::$$$message_0103_0007_0001$$$::My flash of inspiration disappears in a flash.[lr]::
13061::$$$message_0103_0007_0002$$$::It was like I was seeing an incoherent daydream.[lr]::
13062::$$$message_0103_0007_0003$$$::As long as there is a building manager, what I'm doing right now is trespassing without a doubt.[lr]::
13063::$$$message_0103_0007_0004$$$::I need to go outside as soon as possible. There's nothing in this mansion, so I'll go somewhere else.::
913045::$$$message_9103_0003_0000$$$::"...Woah. It's a totally normal house."[r]::

